Subject: Cantor EVO-X2 Scratch Build Live Preflight Observation Design

@ [design_uuid] 5c10b088-af37-4457-9084-e20a116225a4
@ [source_uuid] 7486ab3d-4a69-4f3b-9eb2-d0b914c8bd37
@ [canonical_uuid] 935e020f-8c6f-49e4-b355-63eabd3b778b
@ [predecessor_bookend] 9fe75279a9d0f19d06a69d1f36cbc0b2e36db04e

& [Problem]
  + the published core validates live_remote_preflight but its CLI can construct only supplied provider-free fixtures
  + a public struct plus generic sealer allows a caller to assemble the live claim without preserving which bounded process observation justified it

& [Design]
  + add a strict digest-bound remote probe result for exact target identity and pinned listener/model presence
  + add a strict digest-bound remote preflight observation receipt that embeds the canonical probe result and binds one completed bounded remote call its exact stdout bytes and digest empty stderr and no provider request
  + compile the existing live preflight only from a valid observation receipt and provide strict machine-form ingress and a fresh-process CLI operation
  + retain the existing supplied fixture constructor as a visibly separate evidence class

& [Delineation]
  + inside is pure Rust serialization validation digesting correspondence CLI file ingress and provider-free adversarial tests
  + boundary is a future adapter that actually invokes one read-only remote probe and supplies the resulting receipt
  + outside is network process environment clock filesystem mutation SSH SCP EVO-X2 contact package transfer commission execution provider access install cleanup retry fallback and autonomous work

& [DualHemisphereReview]
  + constructive path makes the missing observation handoff executable and independently replayable
  + adversarial path refuses unknown duplicate noncanonical identity count bound timeout truncation exit output and outcome drift

& [DataDesign]
  + probe result carries profile run request target listener model presence provider status reason and self digest
  + observation carries profile request plan program host transport probe process outcome exact retained stream identities effect accounting and self digest
  + compiled preflight retains the published profile and maps only the two already-authorized outcomes

& [PhaseDecision]
  + implementation is provider-free host-free preparation under the published bookend
  + no live observation may be claimed by tests or evidence and no effectful adapter may execute before its own governed publication boundary
